  'QUESTION', 'question:sq-i1-01', 'Intermediate · Stage 1, How Donation Happens: The Process · Stage Quiz', 'Before any test for brain death begins, the effects of sedatives, a low body temperature and low blood pressure must all be ruled out. Why?',
  'LEGAL', 2, 'APPROVED',
